@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# Paste a JWT obtained from POST /api/auth/login (see auth.http) of an admin user
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI
@idCobro = 1

// Requires: migration 007 run, MERCADOPAGO_PUBLIC_BASE_URL (public https) and a
// Mercado Pago account linked from Configuración (see mercadopago-oauth.http).

### Crear cobro desde una visita (monto = presupuesto Aceptado). Espera 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cobros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_solicitud": 1 }

### Crear cobro manual. Espera 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cobros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monto": 1500.50, "descripcion": "Poda de setos" }

### Monto invalido (3 decimales) - espera 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cobros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monto": 10.123, "descripcion": "x" }

### Visita sin presupuesto Aceptado o cuenta no vinculada - espera 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cobros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_solicitud": 999 }

### Sin token (espera 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cobros
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monto": 100, "descripcion": "x" }

### Listar cobros (opcional ?id_solicitud=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cobros?id_solicitud=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cobros/{{idCobro}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cobro de otro usuario o inexistente (espera 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cobros/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### QR en la plantilla (image/png, solo Pendiente; otro estado -> 409)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cobros/{{idCobro}}/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar (solo Pendiente -> Cancelado, local). Segunda vez -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cobros/{{idCobro}}/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

// WEBHOOK: POST /api/mercadopago/webhook is called by Mercado Pago with an
// x-signature header (ts=...,v1=HMAC) signed with MERCADOPAGO_WEBHOOK_SECRET, so it
// cannot be reproduced by hand. Without a valid signature the answer is 401 (503 if
// the secret is not configured). Test it with a real payment from the Mercado Pago
// panel (Webhooks > Simular notificación) once the notification URL is set.

### Webhook sin firma (espera 401, o 503 si no hay secreto configurado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mercadopago/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "payment", "data": { "id": "123" } }
